{"slotId":"word/document.xml-table-3:row[4]:cell[1]","section":4,"recordId":"word/document.xml-table-3","rowIndex":4,"valueCellIndex":1,"labels":["4.4  接触皮肤："],"labelKeys":["skin_contact"],"noteKey":null,"rowText":"4.4  接触皮肤：\n立即用肥皂和大量的水冲洗。若发生皮肤反应，就医。","componentRow":false}
