{"slotId":"word/document.xml-table-4:row[3]:cell[1]","section":5,"recordId":"word/document.xml-table-4","rowIndex":3,"valueCellIndex":1,"labels":["5.3  物质或混合物的特殊危害："],"labelKeys":["special_hazards"],"noteKey":null,"rowText":"5.3  物质或混合物的特殊危害：\n燃烧时释放一氧化碳、二氧化碳、氮氧化物和少量的氰化氢\n在着火或爆炸情况下，不要吸进烟尘。","componentRow":false}
{"slotId":"word/document.xml-table-4:row[4]:cell[1]","section":5,"recordId":"word/document.xml-table-4","rowIndex":4,"valueCellIndex":1,"labels":["5.4  消防预防措施和保护设备："],"labelKeys":["firefighter_protection"],"noteKey":null,"rowText":"5.4  消防预防措施和保护设备：\n消防人员必须佩戴自供气式呼吸器。\n禁止污染的灭火用水流入土壤，地下水或地表水中。","componentRow":false}
{"slotId":"word/document.xml-table-5:row[1]:cell[1]","section":6,"recordId":"word/document.xml-table-5","rowIndex":1,"valueCellIndex":1,"labels":["6.1  个人预防措施、应急程序："],"labelKeys":["personal_precautions"],"noteKey":null,"rowText":"6.1  个人预防措施、应急程序：\n戴防护设备。远离火源。\n确保充分的通风/排气。令未授权人员离开。","componentRow":false}
{"slotId":"word/document.xml-table-5:row[2]:cell[1]","section":6,"recordId":"word/document.xml-table-5","rowIndex":2,"valueCellIndex":1,"labels":["6.2  环境保护措施："],"labelKeys":["environmental_precautions"],"noteKey":null,"rowText":"6.2  环境保护措施：\n禁止排入下水道，废水或土壤中。","componentRow":false}
