{"slotId":"word/document.xml-table-6:row[1]:cell[1]","section":7,"recordId":"word/document.xml-table-6","rowIndex":1,"valueCellIndex":1,"labels":["7.1  安全操作防范："],"labelKeys":["safe_handling"],"noteKey":null,"rowText":"7.1安全操作防范：\n操作时遵守化学品的常见预防措施。避免与皮肤和眼睛接触。\n远离食物、饮料和烟草。休息以前和工作结束时洗手。将工作服单独存放。\n更换被污染或浸湿的衣物","componentRow":false}
{"slotId":"word/document.xml-table-6:row[2]:cell[1]","section":7,"recordId":"word/document.xml-table-6","rowIndex":2,"valueCellIndex":1,"labels":["7.2  安全储存条件："],"labelKeys":["safe_storage"],"noteKey":null,"rowText":"7.2安全储存条件：\n容器保持紧闭，存储在干燥通风处。为保持产品质量，必须遵守我们产品信息表的储存条件。","componentRow":false}
